== Effect ==
* Upon [[death]], Isaac will respawn as {{c|???}} in the previous room, with 3 {{E|Soul Heart}}s.

== Notes ==
* Resurrection items activate in a [[:Category:Revival items|set order]]. {{dlc|nr}} Ankh is 6th in this order after {{i|1up!}}, {{i|Dead Cat}}, {{c|Lazarus}}' inherent extra life, {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, and {{i|Lazarus' Rags}}.
** {{dlc|r}} Ankh is 8th in this order after {{p|Soul of Lazarus}}, {{i|1up!}}, {{c|Lazarus}}' inherent extra life, {{i|Dead Cat}}, {{i|Inner Child}}, {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, and {{i|Lazarus' Rags}}.
* Like other items that grant an extra life, but respawn Isaac as a different character, all [[completion mark]]s earned from the moment of death onward will count towards the new character, not the old.
* {{dlc+|r}} During {{E|The Beast}} fight, Isaac respawns in the place he died.{{dlc-}}

== Interactions ==
* {{c|Tainted ???}}: Revives as himself, rather than normal ???. Effectively acts as a {{I|1up!}}.

